## Struktur

```
{{ app_name_safe }}-dockerstack/
├── Dockerfile
├── docker-compose.app.yaml        (App + Proxy, DB eksternal)
├── docker-compose.fulldb.yaml     (App + Proxy + DB lokal)
├── .env.example.app
├── .env.example.fulldb
├── .dockerignore                  (.env & artifact tidak di-bake ke image)
├── apache/
│   ├── app.conf.template
│   └── entrypoint.sh
├── ssl/                           (Buat folder ini untuk sertifikat)
└── README.md
```

> **PENTING soal `.env`:** File `.env` **tidak di-bake ke dalam image** (ada di `.dockerignore`) demi keamanan. Variabel environment dimasukkan ke container lewat `env_file: - .env` di docker-compose. Pastikan kamu sudah `cp .env.example.app .env` (atau `.fulldb`) **di folder yang sama dengan docker-compose** sebelum `up`.

## 1. SSL Setup (Wajib sebelum deploy)

Apache membutuhkan file sertifikat SSL agar bisa berjalan di port 443.

**Opsi A: Development (Self-Signed Certificate)**

Jalankan perintah ini di root folder project:
```bash
mkdir -p ssl
openssl req -x509 -nodes -days 365 -newkey rsa:2048 \
  -keyout ssl/cert.key -out ssl/cert.crt \
  -subj "/CN={{ domain }}"
```

**Opsi B: Production (Let's Encrypt / Certbot)**

Jika menggunakan Certbot di host server, ubah volume proxy di docker-compose:
```yaml
volumes:
  - /etc/letsencrypt/live/{{ domain }}/fullchain.pem:/usr/local/apache2/conf/ssl/cert.crt:ro
  - /etc/letsencrypt/live/{{ domain }}/privkey.pem:/usr/local/apache2/conf/ssl/cert.key:ro
```

## 2. Quick Start

### Mode 1: App only (DB eksternal)
```bash
cp .env.example.app .env
# Edit file .env dan isi kredensial database eksternal serta SSO
docker compose -f docker-compose.app.yaml up -d --build
```

### Mode 2: Full stack (DB lokal)
```bash
cp .env.example.fulldb .env
# Edit file .env (pastikan DB_HOST=db)
docker compose -f docker-compose.fulldb.yaml up -d --build
```

